	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312.42 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "45b31f06-b163-42b7-b51d-4637ef6fcf99")
	)
	(text "THE CELL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b705913-9227-4d7a-a7ef-390b0eb9a391")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed on the pads on HS (not at the board):\n4 wires out. 32 AWG twisted from each gauge to the pads,\nslack loops, tied down on HS. Sign and grams: on the bench."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "79b2ea41-a0d8-450a-8848-e02a2a6edcc7")
	)
	(text "THE CABLE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a33cba11-6096-45f4-93fd-d317c6ad3cdc")
	)
	(text "E+/E- one pair, S+/S- one pair. 1 m of 23-24 AWG: ~0.08 R a wire,\n<0.1 % gain (calibrated out). Analog only: no SPI or motor\nwires in this jacket. Check diag() with the motors on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9edfba91-fea9-4c2b-959e-5612a205b734")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "90726272-c53d-4824-ab57-311d7ba29e94")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nRatiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+ (+3V3_PH = +3V3_PB).\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8ad1a2d-f016-496c-a275-a59781700a7e")
	)
	(text "NTC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c8d5539-e0a3-4379-9b55-b53b0cfe9902")
	)
	(text "Optional: GP26 (ADC0) reads the NTC on the strip, for the\nzero's drift with K's motor heat. Return on its own wire."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c3993a35-90d4-4a64-af69-32ea3fbe6f7f")
	)
